{"name":"Damsel","hex":"#c69eae","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"damsel","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A young woman (of noble birth).","A girl; a maiden (without sexual experience)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/damsel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Damsel in distress","blocks":[{"text":"The damsel in distress is a narrative device in which one or more men must rescue a woman who has been kidnapped or placed in other peril. The \"damsel\" is often portrayed as beautiful, popular, and of high social status; she is usually depicted as a princess in works with fantasy or fairy tale settings. Kinship, love, lust or a combination of those motivate the male protagonist to initiate the narrative, and potentially become a hero of valour."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Dicksee-Chivalry-1885.jpg/330px-Dicksee-Chivalry-1885.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damsel_in_distress"},{"title":"Lady-in-waiting","blocks":[{"text":"A lady-in-waiting or court lady is a female personal assistant at a court, attending on a royal woman or a high-ranking noblewoman. Historically, in Europe, a lady-in-waiting was often a noblewoman but of lower rank than the woman to whom she attended. Although she may or may not have received financial or other compensation for her service, a lady-in-waiting was considered more of a secretary, courtier, or companion to her mistress than a servant."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Princess_Tatiana_Alexandrovna_Yusupova%2C_1858.jpg/330px-Princess_Tatiana_Alexandrovna_Yusupova%2C_1858.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lady-in-waiting"},{"title":"Damsel (2024 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Damsel is a 2024 American dark fantasy film directed by Juan Carlos Fresnadillo and written by Dan Mazeau. Millie Bobby Brown stars as Elodie, a young woman who accepts a marriage proposal only to realize that she is being used to repay a royal family's ancient debts and must now escape while surviving attacks from the dragon lurking in the chasm. The rest of the principal cast consists of Ray Winstone, Nick Robinson, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Angela Bassett, and Robin Wright."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f5/Damsel_2024_poster2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damsel_(2024_film)"},{"title":"Damsel (2018 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Damsel is a 2018 American Western black comedy film written and directed by David Zellner and Nathan Zellner. It stars Robert Pattinson and Mia Wasikowska."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e7/Damsel_%282018_film%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damsel_(2018_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Gustave_Dor%C3%A9_Andromeda.jpg/500px-Gustave_Dor%C3%A9_Andromeda.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Gustave_Dor%C3%A9_Andromeda.jpg/500px-Gustave_Dor%C3%A9_Andromeda.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Gustave Doré's depiction of Andromeda chained to the rock—a Romantic-era portrayal of the damsel in distress from Greek mythology","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGustave_Dor%C3%A9_Andromeda.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Paolo_Uccello_050.jpg/500px-Paolo_Uccello_050.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Paolo_Uccello_050.jpg/1280px-Paolo_Uccello_050.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_cam